<!--
    The status-bar icon: the same bubble, redrawn on the 24dp canvas the system expects rather than
    scaled down, so the strokes land on whole pixels at the size it is actually seen.

    A notification icon is a silhouette — the platform throws away every colour in it and keeps only
    the alpha — so the initial has to be a hole, not a white shape on a dark one.
-->
